<div style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif; font-size:14px; color:#333; line-height:1.6;">
  <h2 style="color:#A4262C; margin:0 0 12px;">Text messages are not being sent</h2>
  <p>The SMS company replied: <strong><%= @reason %></strong></p>
  <p>Until this is fixed, members cannot receive verification codes or Kobul alerts by text.
     Members who gave an email address get their verification code by email instead.</p>
  <p><strong>What to do:</strong> log in to your Boom Cast SMS account and top up the balance.
     Texts start working again straight away; nothing needs changing on the website.</p>
